## The skeleton is measured, not designed

`references/records/` holds the raw paragraph records; `references/sections/` holds what was induced
from them; `references/slices/` holds the verbatim chapter text both were induced from. Each chapter's
arc is in its own `00-skeleton.md` §1, with the router mapping a paragraph to the part that does the
work there.

