Every `00-skeleton.md` carries: the router, the arc, the chapter-wide length distribution,
the **chapter-wide zeros** (what this literature never does here), the boundary rules against the
adjacent chapters, and `## For this manuscript`. Every part file carries its Versions plus whatever
ordering / budget / first-split the corpus supports for that part.

